DESCRIPTION:One of four annual processions of the relics of Saint Spyridon\, patron of Corfu. The casket is carried through the old town accompanied by all three philharmonic orchestras. The August one commemorates deliverance from a 1716 Ottoman siege.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#corfu-town-litany-of-agios-spyridon-for-the-1716-siege-corfu
